{"kind":"turn","turn":6,"clockMin":1.81,"child":"5 over 7 bada hai, kyunki numerator 5 bada hai.","childMs":5900,"probe":null,"afterBarge":false,"move":"probe","topic":"c6-maths-ch07-t04","topicSwitch":false,"insTok":1261,"held":7,"heldAudio":7,"ttfa":1071,"words":39,"teacher":"Riya, tumne same denominator me numerator compare kiya, ye ek method hai. Kaunsa bada hai: 4/9 ya 3/4? Choices: 3/4 ya 4/9, because 4 > 3 and 9 > 4, ya they are equal, both are one part short.","status":"completed","audioMs":16450,"modalities":["output_audio"],"inTok":1758,"inText":1428,"inAudio":330,"cached":1088,"cachedText":832,"cachedAudio":256,"outTok":471,"outText":142,"outAudio":329}
